/P 72 0 R
/E (The IEEE SIT Student Branch, established in 2002 under the IEEE Bangalore Section, aims to inspire young minds and showcase ingenuity for a better future. Members actively participate in global and national IEEE symposiums, conferences and workshops to explore emerging technologies across diverse domains. The branch fosters innovation through subgroups in areas such as Robotics, Web Development, App Development, Blogging and Digital Design, offering a vibrant platform for growth and learning.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
