/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (WIE IEEE SIT SB, a part of IEEE SIT SB, is dedicated to empowering and encouraging women in technology, aiming to transform them into innovative and impactful engineers. It recognizes the potential of women to drive change in technology through their dedication, passion and compassion. The group not only organizes technical events such as symposiums and workshops but also engages in humanitarian activities. These include supporting orphans and conducting teaching programs for underprivileged students in rural areas.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
