103 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (WIE CODE, the flagship event of WIE IEEE SIT SB, is a 12-hour national-level hackathon launched in 2019-20. It focuses on solving real-world problems by developing software or hardware solutions in participants' chosen domains. Dedicated to encouraging women in technology, WIE CODE inspires attendees to create practical and impactful solutions to real-time challenges. Each edition revolves around a theme, emphasizing the transformative power of innovation. Through comprehensive mentoring and a competitive environment, the event fosters thoughtfulness and inventiveness. Its success has consistently drawn large participation, making it one of the most celebrated events hosted by WIE IEEE SIT SB.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
